  "description": "The Blueridge Xplore GT Select 6.1 is the ultimate dropbar touring bike, engineered for speed and long-distance road trips. As the fastest model in the Tout Terrain expedition lineup, this bike blends comfortable Thermocrom steel frame durability with race-ready efficiency.\n\nPinion Gearbox Drivetrain: Features a reliable Pinion C1.12 gearbox with a low-maintenance Gates Carbon Drive belt system. This combination delivers smooth, maintenance-free gear changes and an extended 600% gear range.\n\nSpeed & Control: Rolls on efficient 28\" (700c) wheels fitted with Vittoria Randonneur Tech 700Cx42mm tires. Powerful TRP Hylex hydraulic disc brakes with 180/160mm rotors ensure confident deceleration on fast descents.\n\nDropbar Ergonomics: Built with a Tout Terrain Gravel Racing Handlebar (440mm with 16° flare) and the specialized Tout Terrain Shift:R Road for Pinion lever for improved shifting and multiple hand positions.\n\nFully Equipped for Expedition: Comes complete with the Integrated Expedition Rack II (40kg capacity), SKS Bluemels 60mm mudguards, and lighting powered by a Shutter PL-7 hub dynamo. It offers a high total capacity of 180kg.\n\nFrame Details: Available in sizes M, L, and XL, and finished in Atlantico Metallic Shiny. The frame includes 4 bottle holder mounting positions and is paired with a Tout Terrain Touring Carbon Fork III.\n\nRack: Tout Terrain E-Expedition Rack II with EX Rails II (black, hard anodized)\n\nM L XL\n\nA SEAT TUBE LENGTH (mm) 510 560 610\n\nA1 SEAT TUBE LENGTH (mm) 450 501 552\n\nb TOP TUBE LENGTH (mm) 575 595 615\n\nC CONTROL TUBE LENGTH (mm) 175 205 225\n\nD CHAIN STAY LENGTH (mm) 455 455 455\n\nE WHEELBASE (mm) 1077 1087 1095\n\nF BOTTOM BRACKET LOWERING (mm) 70 70 70\n\nG HEAD TUBE ANGLE (*) 70.5 71 71.5\n\nH SEAT TUBE ANGLE (*) 73 72.5 72\n\nI STACK (mm) 614 644 665\n\nJ REACH (mm) 387 392 399\n\nK OVERHANG HEIGHT (mm) 808 846 879\n\nL FORK INSTALLATION HEIGHT (mm) 407 407 407\n\nM FORK OFFSET (mm) 45 45 45",
